+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 */
+/*
+ * FPC TrustZone application protocol — transport-independent core.
+ *
+ * The command tables, the request/response layouts and the call sequences in
+ * this file are derived from
+ *
+ *     https://github.com/sonyxperiadev/vendor-sony-oss-fingerprint
+ *     Copyright (C) 2016 Shane Francis / Jens Andersen
+ *     Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
+ *
+ * specifically tz_api_yoshino.h, tz_api_loire_tone.h and
+ * fpc_imp_yoshino_nile_tama.c.  This file stays under Apache-2.0 for that
+ * reason; do not relicense it.
+ *
