+ *
+ * Derived from libfprint's own FPC driver, drivers/fpcmoc/fpc.c:
+ *   Copyright (c) 2022 Fingerprint Cards AB <tech@fingerprints.com>
+ * The class wiring, the SSM shape, the enrol/identify/list/delete/clear flow
+ * and the print serialisation are theirs; what changed is the transport (USB
+ * bulk framing -> a synchronous trustlet call) and the command set, which now
+ * comes from fpc-tz.[ch].
